      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 месяцев назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Specijalna bolnica Brezovik is a well-known medical facility located in a peaceful, green area just outside Nikšić. Surrounded by nature and fresh air, it offers a calm environment that supports recovery and rest.\n\nThe staff is generally professional and dedicated, providing care and support to patients with attention and responsibility. The surroundings add to the overall positive feeling, making it a place where medical care meets a quiet and healing atmosphere.\n\nA respected institution with a long tradition, known for its serene location and important role in healthcare in Montenegro.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Specijalna bolnica Brezovik is a well-known medical facility located in a peaceful, green area just outside Nikšić. Surrounded by nature and fresh air, it offers a calm environment that supports recovery and rest.\n\nThe staff is generally professional and dedicated, providing care and support to patients with attention and responsibility. The surroundings add to the overall positive feeling, making it a place where medical care meets a quiet and healing atmosphere.\n\nA respected institution with a long tradition, known for its serene location and important role in healthcare in Montenegro.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
